        "gu_year_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Fan’s recorded information states that the ice is a newly created rank eight immortal material made by Immortal Bing Ren to seal two Immortal Gu. One is rank six year Gu. The other is the flowing water itself: the rank eight time path Immortal Gu Years Flow Like Water, Hei Fan’s greatest treasure in that inheritance.",
